{'symbol': 'AMGN', 'date': '2022-10-28 16:00:00', 'title': 'AMGEN ANNOUNCES 2022 FOURTH QUARTER DIVIDEND', 'text': 'THOUSAND OAKS, CALIF. , OCT. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMGEN (NASDAQ:AMGN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A $1.94 PER SHARE DIVIDEND FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2022.'}